messages.reasoning_content:
So alias maps "aliasName" -> "target"? Actually `fontNameAliasMapping.put(fontName, alias)`. getSystemFontPath does `fontNameAliasMapping.get(fontName)` yields name, then if fontNamePathMapping contains key name return. So call addAliasMapping("MyAlias", "TargetFont") maps MyAlias->TargetFont. So FontUtils.addAliasMapping(familyName, fontName, aliasFamilyName, aliasFontName): familyName -> aliasFamilyName, fontName -> aliasFontName. To get alias resolution, need addSystemFontMapping(aliasFamilyName, path) / addSystemFontMapping(aliasFontName, path). So:
```
